Description: Mainuan welcome and first-login assistant
 Native Qt/Kirigami welcome application of the Mainuan desktop. It opens on
 login (users can turn this off), lets the user choose the visual style,
 theme, accent colour and desktop layout, and installs media codecs, the
 ClamAV antivirus with the ClamUI interface, the UFW firewall with its
 Plasma module, office suites and web browsers with real progress.
 .
 Privileged operations go through a small helper authorized by polkit
 that accepts only a fixed set of installation profiles.
